{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_015jzQZL8ZtjXeTmWgovG41c","type":"tool_result","content":"{\"result\":\"{\\\"success\\\": true, \\\"data\\\": {\\\"path\\\": \\\"/home/ubuntu/.agent-ml-research-idea_gen_0514_4/projects/distrib_canary_collapse/decisions.yaml\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"_next_id: 11\\\\ndecisions:\\\\n- id: D001\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 04:23 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'MVP 设计: Pythia-410M × WikiText-103 × 100% SC × 10 gen × 3 reps，验证 canary\\\\n    时序领先性'\\\\n  rationale: 100% SC 是最激进的 collapse 条件（理论预测必然退化），如果在此条件下没有任何 canary 指标领先 downstream，项目前提不成立。3\\\\n    reps × 10 gen 给出足够时间点做 cross-correlation。计算量 ~9 H100-hours，极低风险。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D002\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 04:26 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP ECE 用 next-token calibration，SC 协议用 full replacement，effective rank\\\\n    用模型自身 embedding\\\\n  rationale: 'Reviewer warning 要求澄清 3 个操作化定义。ECE: next-token calibration 是 LM 原生度量、零额外成本，与\\\\n    Du et al. 的对比留到全量阶段加 downstream task ECE。SC: full replacement 是最大 feedback amplification\\\\n    (Truong & Truong Class 1)，collapse 信号最强，适合 MVP 压力测试。Effective rank: 模型自身 embedding\\\\n    与 SIGMA 一致，零额外依赖。'\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D001\\\\n- id: D003\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 04:27 UTC\\\\n  summary: 首选 AAAI 2027 (~Aug 2026)，May 25 ARR 不可行，后续 ARR cycle 备选\\\\n  rationale: 项目 2026-05-14 立项，无服务器无代码，11 天内无法完成 MVP + 全量实验 + 论文。AAAI 2027 给 ~2.5 个月，充分覆盖\\\\n    500-600 H100-hours 的实验量和论文写作。后续 ARR cycle (Jul/Aug) 也在射程内。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D001\\\\n- id: D004\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 05:36 UTC\\\\n  summary: 'MVP 参数修复: n_prompts 1000→5000, steps_per_gen 10000→5000 (4 epochs/gen)'\\\\n  rationale: Reviewer 发现原配置下 40 epochs/gen 在 1000 samples 上严重过拟合，模型可能 1-2 代即骤然击穿，所有指标同时崩溃，无法观察\\\\n    lead-lag 时序结构。修改后 4 epochs/gen 接近文献实践，collapse 逐渐发展，给 cross-correlation 分析留出足够时间点。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D001\\\\n  - D002\\\\n- id: D005\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 08:39 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP 中期决策：不重启实验，MAUVE demote 为 supplementary，等完整 10-gen 数据再判断 collapse 速度和\\\\n    lead-lag\\\\n  rationale: MAUVE 基线 0.034 触发 evaluation criteria §4 floor effect 规则。Gen 0→1 跳变大是\\\\\\\"未训练→首次训练\\\\\\\"的固有落差，后续\\\\n    gen 的增量变化才是分析目标。100% SC 如果确认无 lead-lag，null result 符合 Truong & Truong 一阶相变理论——是有意义的发现，不是实验失败。重启只会浪费更多\\\\n    GPU 时间。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D004\\\\n- id: D006\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 17:37 UTC\\\\n  summary: 论文 framing 采用 \\\\\\\"delineating predictability boundaries\\\\\\\" 而非 \\\\\\\"universal canary\\\\\\\"\\\\n  rationale: 2-seed 预分析显示 canary 仅 lead diversity (distinct_n) 不 lead perplexity。ECE→perplexity\\\\n    甚至反向 (lag=+5)。\\\\\\\"predictability boundary\\\\\\\" framing 将 null result 转化为 evidence：100%\\\\n    SC 是同步崩溃 regime（不可预测），较低 α 可能出现渐进退化（可预测）。此 framing 对 null result 天然鲁棒，与 Truong\\\\n    & Truong 相变理论自然对接，reviewer 攻击面最小。Reviewer 独立预审认同此方向为最强 framing。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_v4_rep42\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: canary→distinct_n SIGNIFICANT, canary→perplexity NO LEAD\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_v4_rep43\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: same pattern confirmed\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D007\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 17:37 UTC\\\\n  summary: Post-MVP 实验优先级：α-sweep >> 方法 ablation > C4 数据集 > 规模验证\\\\n  rationale: α-sweep (25/50/75%) 是唯一能回答\\\\\\\"canary 在温和 regime 下是否 lead perplexity\\\\\\\"的实验，决定论文从\\\\n    diversity-only predictor 到 regime-dependent general predictor 的 claim 升级。方法 ablation\\\\n    零 GPU 成本、高 ROI（回答 reviewer 方法论质疑）。C4 堵 domain-specific 攻击。规模验证优先级最低（Pythia 家族共享架构，只测一个维度）。Reviewer\\\\n    预审排序一致。\\\\n  related_experiments: []\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D006\\\\n- id: D008\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 17:37 UTC\\\\n  summary: distinct_3 lead-lag 结果待 4-seed 确认，如 lag 仍双峰则降级 inconclusive，主文只报 distinct_1/distinct_2\\\\n  rationale: distinct_3 的 lag 估计跨 seed 不稳定（lag=-5 vs lag=-1，lag_std=2.0）。lag=-5 触及\\\\n    max_lag 边界，N=11 下只剩 6 点做相关，统计意义极弱，可能是边界效应伪信号。distinct_1/distinct_2 的 lag 跨 seed\\\\n    完全一致（lag_std=0），足以支撑核心 claim。Reviewer 建议 distinct_3 放 supplementary 并注明不稳定性。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_v4_rep42\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: distinct_3 lag=-5\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_v4_rep43\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: distinct_3 lag=-1\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D006\\\\n- id: D009\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 18:59 UTC\\\\n  summary: MVP 4-seed STRONG PASS，进入 Research 阶段全面实验\\\\n  rationale: 4/4 seed 一致确认 token_entropy 和 ECE 领先 diversity 指标 1-2 代（p<0.004）。核心发现：canary\\\\n    只领先 diversity collapse 不领先 perplexity degradation，这定义了 narrative 方向。plan_006 升级\\\\n    P0 以解决 max_lag 截断疑虑。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_v4_rep42\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: success\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_v4_rep43\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: success\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_v4_rep44\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: success\\\\n  - exp_id: mvp_v4_rep45\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: success\\\\n  depends_on: []\\\\n- id: D010\\\\n  date: 2026-05-14 19:10 UTC\\\\n  summary: plan_003 重分析修正 perplexity 通道叙述：WEAK LEAD 非断裂，ECE 反向因果，维持 D008 distinct_3\\\\n    降级\\\\n  rationale: max_lag=7 重分析三个关键发现：(1) token_entropy→perplexity lag=-5 是真实峰值非截断伪影，但\\\\n    p=0.058-0.12 在 N=11 下不显著——\\\\\\\"通道断裂\\\\\\\"改为\\\\\\\"弱信号、效力不足\\\\\\\"；(2) ECE→perplexity 呈反向因果(lag=+4/+5,\\\\n    p<0.01)，两个 canary 家族在 perplexity 通道方向相反，论文必须讨论；(3) distinct_3 虽升 SIGNIFICANT 但\\\\n    lag_std>1.5（双峰），维持 D008 降级。plan_006(20-gen, N=21) 成为 framing 关键判定实验。\\\\n  related_experiments:\\\\n  - exp_id: plan_003\\\\n    role: evidence\\\\n    result: max_lag=7 重分析完成，核心 lead 稳固，perplexity 通道发现新细节\\\\n  depends_on:\\\\n  - D008\\\\n  - D009\\\\n\\\", \\\"total_chars\\\": 4841, \\\"truncated\\\": false}, \\\"error\\\": null, \\\"metadata\\\": {}}\"}"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01A3eW8Bu12rW98rdtNxEmLk","session_id":"94fcddd3-8b83-4721-94fe-5ba1b028b20f","uuid":"e8c7239a-b094-4b44-ae72-78a73560fdff","timestamp":"2026-05-14T19:28:29.894Z"}
